# generated at runtime. reports/ is OUTPUT: batch reports, the decision log, the
# audit, the eval and the stability numbers are all produced by a run and none of
# them are committed. A committed report is a run frozen on the day it was made,
# and it goes on looking current long after it has stopped being true.
reports/
*.tmp
